.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
# Default host directory of the embedding weights (docker-compose.yml,
# EMBEDDING_MODELS_DIR): gigabytes of model files, never in git.
models/
# evaluation/bench_data: the benchmark results are tracked, the caches are not.
# Results (results_*.json), generated rewrite variants (*_rewrites_*.json) and
# generated rerank answers (*_reranks_*.json) cannot be regenerated: answers
# from Maria's private Qwen server and the OpenRouter candidates exist only as
# these files, and the Gemini runs depend on free-tier quota and on models that
# may be retired (Maria, 2026-09-04). Corpus exports, embedding matrices, the
# provider-call cache and the rerank INPUT artifacts (rerank_input_*.json —
# rebuilt from a tracked results_*.json plus the database) are large and
# regenerable, and stay local.
evaluation/bench_data/*
!evaluation/bench_data/results_*.json
!evaluation/bench_data/*_rewrites_*.json
!evaluation/bench_data/*_reranks_*.json
!evaluation/bench_data/*.tsv
# Sense files (*_senses_*.jsonl) are generated once by a strong model and
# cannot be regenerated identically; the offline answer files and the batch
# files they came from stay local (regenerable with prepare / kept as inputs).
!evaluation/bench_data/*_senses_*.jsonl
!evaluation/bench_data/*_senses_*.jsonl.meta.json
# The probe id list is a few hundred bytes and is what makes the
# description probe set (86cbeef7h) reproducible on another machine.
!evaluation/bench_data/description_probe_ids.txt
# Transcription benchmark (86cbegg3m): the sample list and the per-model
# outputs are tracked — they are the side-by-side material Maria judges the
# Russian quality by, and the Gemini run cannot be reproduced identically
# later. The AUDIO EXCERPTS are not: they live in
# evaluation/bench_data/transcribe_audio/ and stay local, being 4 MB of
# derivative Bible recordings that `transcribe_bench.py` re-cuts from
# ${AUDIO_DIR} in seconds.
!evaluation/bench_data/transcribe_samples.json
!evaluation/bench_data/transcribe_*.jsonl
# Leading-question answers (86cbegctz): a few dozen kilobytes, and the same
# reason as the rewrite/rerank artifacts — the Qwen answers come from Maria's
# private server and the Gemini ones from free-tier quota on a model that may
# be retired, so neither run can be reproduced identically later.
!evaluation/bench_data/questions_*.jsonl
!evaluation/bench_data/questions_*.jsonl.meta.json
# Semantic repeat detection (86cbehyg8): 176 scored pairs, ~50 kB. Tracked for
# the same reason — the vectors come from the company server's bge-m3, so the
# scores cannot be reproduced without it. The sidecar names the host and the
# model and carries no key.
!evaluation/bench_data/question_pairs_scored.jsonl
!evaluation/bench_data/question_pairs_scored.jsonl.meta.json
# Human-readable protocols of the question work (86cbehygb): the live check of
# the running endpoint and the before/after transcripts Maria reads. A few
# dozen kilobytes of prose, and the least reproducible artifacts of all — they
# record what one live run of a temperature-0.7 model answered on one day.
!evaluation/bench_data/live_*.md
!evaluation/bench_data/before_after_*.md
# Raw model comparison and offline review package (86cbejhh9).
!evaluation/bench_data/question_comparison_*/
!evaluation/bench_data/question_comparison_*/*.json
!evaluation/bench_data/question_comparison_*/*.jsonl
!evaluation/bench_data/question_comparison_*/*.md
!evaluation/bench_data/question_comparison_*/*.html
!evaluation/bench_data/question_comparison_prompt_v5_ablation/**/
!evaluation/bench_data/question_comparison_prompt_v5_ablation/**/*.json
!evaluation/bench_data/question_comparison_prompt_v5_ablation/**/*.jsonl
!evaluation/bench_data/question_comparison_prompt_v5_ablation/**/*.html
!evaluation/bench_data/question_comparison_prompt_v5_ablation/**/*.md
# Sampling configurations of the leading question (86cbejvra): four runs of
# Qwen3-30B on prompt v5, one directory each plus the report over them. Same
# reason as every artifact above — the answers come from the company server at
# a given temperature on a given day and cannot be reproduced identically.
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6a_sampling/
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6a_sampling/*.md
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6a_sampling/**/
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6a_sampling/**/*.json
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6a_sampling/**/*.jsonl
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6a_sampling/**/*.md
# Парное судейство вопросов v6 против v5 (86cbejvtd): пары с промптами,
# вердикты судей и отчёт над ними, плюс вложенные каталоги самих прогонов
# `compare_question_models.py`. Причина та же, что у всех артефактов выше:
# ответы модели и вердикты судьи получены на конкретный день и не
# воспроизводятся идентично.
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6_vs_v5/
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6_vs_v5/*.json
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6_vs_v5/*.jsonl
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6_vs_v5/*.md
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6_vs_v5/**/
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6_vs_v5/**/*.json
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6_vs_v5/**/*.jsonl
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6_vs_v5/**/*.md
!evaluation/bench_data/question_v6_vs_v5/**/*.html
